Hello there Mark!  I'm a representative from Horizons Unlimited, the new
authors of Skyline BBS, and I just wanted to let you know that you can
welcome another system to your documents of Hack & Slash!  Skyline will now
run the door version of Hack & Slash.  If you wish to include this in the
installation part of the documents, here is what is required to be added to
the @CLIDOORS section of the system's game menu:
 
<Menu Command> 0 <Path of HSClient>hsclient -e -h -t_ "|"[off%c\
  Where Menu Command is the letter or character to trigger the game, path is
where hsclient is installed (i.e. "JMP:HS/"), and the rest is to send the
necessary time, name, and configuration parameters.  Thanks for such a great
game!

